      "body": "Exact-head self-review at `24735794bc5d9ed351e8ef98188f155a725dc4e3` (owner rule: self-review allowed). Merged origin/main (no conflicts). Checks at this head: `cargo check -p uor-r4-training --example mqar-bench` 0 errors; release build + 2-step CPU smoke with `select=top:1` and `select=none` both complete, `select=top:1` recorded in config/report and changes the read (max |dlogit| 0.010118 vs 0.010112); rustfmt drift reported in this file is pre-existing main code (lines outside this PR's 4 hunks). APPROVE.",
